{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the ball in first person and try not to get motion sick! A movement system that is so relentless, unexpected and fun will put your gaming skills to the ultimate test! <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/extras/Different_locations.png?t=1740741342\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/extras/GifLocations.gif?t=1740741342\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each location is made in a unique style and provides unique gameplay.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/extras/Funny_moments.png?t=1740741342\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/extras/gifFirstPerson.gif?t=1740741342\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend hours trying and failing the same path! I promise someone will find it funny how you scream at the computer screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/extras/FEATURES.png?t=1740741342\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/extras/gifThirdPerson.gif?t=1740741342\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your ball </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dizzying gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot of rage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three difficulties: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy - Third person only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Medium - First person while moving, third person while idle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard - First person only<br>    </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to get angry, laugh and cry as you race for the ball in an adventure that is challenging to play but impossible to put down. <br><br>Are you ready for the challenge? </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550920?t=1740741342","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/a0653a11f33f3044fb91f1bf76015a5fb3b713ca/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740741342","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/57b2cdea25ad1aecb10f5e493d3acb6143e5ddd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740741342","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/57b2cdea25ad1aecb10f5e493d3acb6143e5ddd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740741342","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the ball in first person and try not to get motion sick! A movement system that is so relentless, unexpected and fun will put your gaming skills to the ultimate test! <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/extras/Different_locations.png?t=1740741342\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/extras/GifLocations.gif?t=1740741342\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each location is made in a unique style and provides unique gameplay.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/extras/Funny_moments.png?t=1740741342\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/extras/gifFirstPerson.gif?t=1740741342\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend hours trying and failing the same path! I promise someone will find it funny how you scream at the computer screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/extras/FEATURES.png?t=1740741342\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/extras/gifThirdPerson.gif?t=1740741342\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your ball </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dizzying gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot of rage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three difficulties: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy - Third person only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Medium - First person while moving, third person while idle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard - First person only<br>    </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to get angry, laugh and cry as you race for the ball in an adventure that is challenging to play but impossible to put down. <br><br>Are you ready for the challenge? </p>","developers":["NSF-Chan"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550920/header.jpg?t=1740741342","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 750ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recom